  "description": "<p>Do you want to study at a university best known for its internationally accredited Global MBA program?</p><p>Want to excel in business, management and technology disciplines?</p><p>Then GISMA Business School is your right choice!</p><p>Previously known as GISMA University of Applied Sciences, this is one of the largest private universities in Germany.</p><p>GISMA is best known for its Global MBA program, one of only six AMBA-accredited MBA programs in Germany. The school also offers specialised courses in artificial intelligence, data science, and international business management.</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p><p>GISMA Business School was established in 1999 and has partnered with several popular institutions such as Grenoble Ecole de Management, Kingston University and <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/institutions/the-university-of-law/\">The University of Law</a>.</p><p>Many programs at GISMA are taught entirely in English and are renowned for their high international standards.</p><p>GISMA offers bachelor’s and master’s courses in International Business Management, Data Science, AI, Computer Science, Software Engineering, Leadership for Digital Transformation, and the renowned Global MBA program.</p><p>GISMA emphasises practical education in management by offering lectures from professors and top executives from various industries.</p><p>Want to know more? Discover why GISMA Business School might be the place for you!</p><p><strong>Why GISMA Business School?</strong></p><ul><li>GISMA is renowned for its high-quality education and industry-relevant business programs in English and German.</li><li>The university has strong connections with industry leaders and professionals, providing networking opportunities to students.</li><li>GISMA’s faculty comprises experienced professionals from several parts of the world, offering students a global learning experience.</li></ul><p><strong>Student Life</strong></p><p>With students from over 40 nationalities, the university provides a global learning environment.</p><p>Students at GISMA can attend German language classes as part of their course at no extra cost. This will help them pursue job opportunities in Germany or elsewhere in Europe.</p><p>GISMA strongly commits to supporting students’ career development. The university's Career Centre works closely with companies across Germany to provide students with career workshops, networking events, and internship opportunities.</p><p>Located in Germany, GISMA offers students many opportunities for exploring and sightseeing too!</p>",
